<!-- S1: INTRO -->
<div class="section c-yellow" id="s1">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-num">01</div>
    <div class="sec-title">Python kya hai?</div>
    <span class="sec-emoji">🐍</span>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <p>Python ek <strong>high-level, general-purpose programming language</strong> hai jo 1991 mein <strong>Guido van Rossum</strong> ne banai. Iska syntax English jaisa clean hota hai isliye beginners ke liye best choice hai.</p>
    <br>
    <div class="g2">
      <div>
        <div class="card-label">✅ Kyun sikhein?</div>
        <ul style="list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px">
          <li>🟡 Bahut simple syntax</li>
