          <li>🟡 AI, Web, Data — sab mein use</li>
          <li>🟡 Badi community, free resources</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="card-label">🚀 Kahan use hoti hai?</div>
        <ul style="list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px">
          <li>🔵 Web Dev — Django, Flask</li>
          <li>🔵 AI / ML — TensorFlow, PyTorch</li>
          <li>🔵 Data Science — Pandas, NumPy</li>
          <li>🔵 Automation, Scripting, Games</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cb">
    <div class="cb-top"><div class="dot dr"></div><div class="dot dy"></div><div class="dot dg"></div><span class="cb-file">hello.py</span></div>
    <pre><span class="cm"># Pehla Python program</span>
<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="st">"Hello, World! 🌍"</span>)
